        },
        "lead": "Claude Phillips, 1897:"
      },
      {
        "kind": "quote",
        "text": "Sacred and Profane Love (Italian: Amor Sacro e Amor Profano) is an oil painting by Titian, probably painted in 1514, early in his career.",
        "source": {
          "author": "Wikipedia contributors",
          "title": "Sacred and Profane Love",
          "publisher": "Wikipedia",
          "readAt": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sacred_and_Profane_Love",
